{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-title='Apache Tomcat'>\r\n\t\t\tApache Tomcat\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Object object = ((Context)(new InitialContext().lookup(\"java:comp/env\")).lookup(\"mykey\");.","label":"Context - Environment variables","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/compression","label":"Compression","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/compression"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_parameters","label":"Context - parameters","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_parameters"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Context&gt;&lt;Environment name=\"mykey\" value=\"myvalue\" type=\"java.lang.String\"\/&gt;&lt;\/Context&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tObject object = ((Context)(new InitialContext().lookup(\"java:comp\/env\")).lookup(\"mykey\");.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tHandling NamingException.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPublic String getFromEnvironment(final String name).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t{.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf(name == null) return null;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTry.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t{.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFinal Object object = ((Context)(new InitialContext().lookup(\"java:comp\/env\"))).lookup(name);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf (object != null) return object.toString();.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t} catch (final Exception e) {}.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tReturn System.getenv(name);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t}.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>JUnit test.<\/strong> The naming bits used by Tomcat are in a JAR file not in the TOMCAT_HOME\/lib, but instead in the TOMCAT_HOME\/bin\/tomcat-juli.jar file!.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_environment_variables\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_environment_variables\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/compression' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/compression' data-title='Compression' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Compression<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_parameters' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_parameters' data-title='Context - parameters' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div clas